<title>GERMANY: HP says to grow faster than German market.</title>
<headline>HP says to grow faster than German market.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. computer and printer maker Hewlett-Packard Co said on Tuesday net earnings at its German subsidiary fell last year but it would grow faster than the market in 1997.</p>
<p>Profit after taxes slipped to 127 million marks ($74.4 million) in the year ending October 31, 1996 from 141 million the year before. The company said previous year earnings benefited from tax bonuses not available in 1996.</p>
